@startuml

!define STATE_DOWN_COLOR #FFB6C1
!define STATE_UP_COLOR #90EE90
!define STATE_SUSPECT_COLOR #FFD700

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<DOWN>> STATE_DOWN_COLOR
  BackgroundColor<<UP>> STATE_UP_COLOR
  BackgroundColor<<SUSPECT>> STATE_SUSPECT_COLOR
  BorderColor #333333
  ArrowColor #333333
}

[*] --> DOWN : LogicNode initialization

state "DOWN" as DOWN <<DOWN>> {
  DOWN : **State**: Not operational
  DOWN : **Inactivity**: >= HARD_THRESHOLD (10 ticks)
  DOWN : 
  DOWN : **Actions**:
  DOWN : • RestartManager schedules restart
  DOWN : • Exponential backoff (2s, 4s, 8s, 16s, 30s)
}

state "UP" as UP <<UP>> {
  UP : **State**: Healthy
  UP : **Inactivity**: < SOFT_THRESHOLD (5 ticks)
  UP : 
  UP : **Actions**:
  UP : • Reset inactivity counter
  UP : • Normal operation
}

state "SUSPECT" as SUSPECT <<SUSPECT>> {
  SUSPECT : **State**: May be failing
  SUSPECT : **Inactivity**: >= SOFT_THRESHOLD
  SUSPECT : **Inactivity**: < HARD_THRESHOLD
  SUSPECT : 
  SUSPECT : **Actions**:
  SUSPECT : • Sends NODE_ALIVE_CHECK
  SUSPECT : • Wait for response
}

DOWN --> UP : **Trigger**: First heartbeat received\n**Event**: register_heartbeat(node_id, ts)\n**Action**: mark_up(node_id)

UP --> SUSPECT : **Trigger**: No heartbeat for SOFT_THRESHOLD\n**Event**: tick() x 5 \n**Action**: send_check(node_id)

SUSPECT --> UP : **Trigger**: Node responds to check\n**Event**: NODE_ALIVE_RESPONSE received\n**Action**: mark_up(node_id)

SUSPECT --> DOWN : **Trigger**: No response for HARD_THRESHOLD\n**Event**: tick() x 10 \n**Action**: mark_down(node_id)

UP --> UP : **Event**: Heartbeat received\n**Action**: inactivity = 0

SUSPECT --> SUSPECT : **Event**: tick() without response\n**Action**: inactivity++

DOWN --> DOWN : **Event**: Restart failed\n**Action**: Backoff delay++

@enduml
